<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ericsson upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ericsson upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded Telefon AB L.M. Ericsson to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1-1/4 to 30-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
